        <span class="section-eyebrow">Experience Golden Grand Royal</span>
        <h2>A warm, dependable stay in the heart of Kabba</h2>
        <p style="margin-top:0.9rem; color:var(--color-text-muted);">Golden Grand Royal Hotel offers comfortable accommodation and attentive hospitality for travellers, families and business guests visiting Kabba, Kogi State. From restful rooms to dining and event spaces, every part of your stay is looked after by a friendly team.</p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
